{"total":40,"items":[{"id":"69b6c59add1a4c9c86f09682","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320","bookIndex":32,"hadithIndex":3969,"bookHadithIndex":1,"text":"Telah menceritakan kepada kami [Abdullah bin Muhammad An Nufaili] telah menceritakan kepada kami [Hatim bin Isma'il]. (dalam jalur lain disebutkan) Telah menceritakan kepada kami [Nashr bin 'Ashim] telah menceritakan kepada kami [Yahya bin Sa'id] dari [Ja'far bin Muhammad] dari [Ayahnya] dan [Jabir] radliallahu 'anhu, bahwa Nabi shallallahu 'alaihi wasallam membaca ayat: '(Dan jadikanlah sebahagian maqam Ibrahim tempat shalat) ' (Qs. Al Baqarah:)","grades":[{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3969-alalbani","name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3969-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid","name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3969-zubairalizai","name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}]},{"id":"69b6c59add1a4c9c86f09683","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320","bookIndex":32,"hadithIndex":3970,"bookHadithIndex":2,"text":"","grades":[{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3970-alalbani","name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3970-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid","name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3970-zubairalizai","name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}]},{"id":"69b6c59add1a4c9c86f09684","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320","bookIndex":32,"hadithIndex":3971,"bookHadithIndex":3,"text":"Telah menceritakan kepada kami [Qutaibah bin Sa'id] telah menceritakan kepada kami [Abdul Wahid bin Ziyad] telah menceritakan kepada kami [Khushaif] telah menceritakan kepada kami [Miqsam] mantan budak Ibnu Abbas, ia berkata, [Ibnu Abbas] radliallahu 'anhu berkata, \"Turunnya ayat ini: '(Tidak mungkin seorang nabi berkhianat dalam urusan harta rampasan perang) ' (Qs. Ali Imran: 161), berkenaan dengan hilangnya kasur merah di badar. Sebagian orang mengatakan, \"Kemungkinan Rasulullah shallallahu 'alaihi wasallam mengambilnya, maka Allah 'azza wajalla menurunkan ayat: '(Tidak mungkin seorang nabi berkhianat dalam urusan harta rampasan perang) ' (Qs. Ali Imran: 161), hingga akhir ayat.\" Abu Daud berkata, \"Yaghulla, dengan memberi harakat fathah pada huruf ya","grades":[{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3971-alalbani","name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3971-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid","name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3971-zubairalizai","name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}]},{"id":"69b6c59add1a4c9c86f09685","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320","bookIndex":32,"hadithIndex":3972,"bookHadithIndex":4,"text":"Telah menceritakan kepada kami [Muhammad bin Isa] telah menceritakan kepada kami [Mu'tamir] ia berkata; aku mendengar [Ayahku] berkata; aku pernah mendengar [Anas bin Malik] berkata, \"Nabi shallallahu 'alaihi wasallam bersabda: \"ALLAAHUMMA INNII A'UUDZU BIKA MINAL BUKHLI WAL HARAMI (Ya Allah, aku berlindung kepada-Mu dari sifat kikir dan pikun)","grades":[{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3972-alalbani","name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3972-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid","name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3972-shuaibalarnaut","name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3972-zubairalizai","name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (2823) Sahih Muslim (2706)"}]},{"id":"69b6c59add1a4c9c86f09686","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320","bookIndex":32,"hadithIndex":3973,"bookHadithIndex":5,"text":"","grades":[{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3973-alalbani","name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3973-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid","name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3973-zubairalizai","name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}]},{"id":"69b6c59add1a4c9c86f09687","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320","bookIndex":32,"hadithIndex":3974,"bookHadithIndex":6,"text":"Telah menceritakan kepada kami [Muhammad bin Isa] telah menceritakan kepada kami [Sufyan] telah menceritakan kepada kami ['Amru bin Dinar] dari ['Atha] dari [Ibnu Abbas] ia berkata, \"Orang-orang muslim bertemu dengan seorang laki-laki yang membawa kambingnya, kemudian ia mengucapkan, 'Assalaamu 'alaikum! ' Lalu mereka membunuhnya dan mengambil kambing tersebut. Maka turunlah ayat: '(Dan janganlah kamu mengatakan kepada orang yang mengucapkan 'salam' kepadamu: 'Kamu bukan seorang mukmin' (lalu kamu membunuhnya), dengan maksud mencari harta benda kehidupan di dunia) ' (Qs. An Nisaa: 94), yaitu kambing tersebut","grades":[{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3974-alalbani","name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3974-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid","name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3974-shuaibalarnaut","name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3974-zubairalizai","name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (4591) Sahih Muslim (3025)"}]},{"id":"69b6c59add1a4c9c86f09688","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320","bookIndex":32,"hadithIndex":3975,"bookHadithIndex":7,"text":"Telah menceritakan kepada kami [Sa'id bin Manshur] telah menceritakan kepada kami [Ibnu Abu Az Zinad]. (dalam jalur lain disebutkan) Telah menceritakan kepada kami [Muhammad bin Sulaiman Al Anbari] telah menceritakan kepada kami [Hajjaj bin Muhammad] dari [Ibnu Abu Az Zinad Asyba'] dari [Ayahnya] dari [Kharijah bin Zaid bin Tsabit] dari [Ayahnya], bahwa Nabi shallallahu 'alaihi wasallam membaca ayat: (yang tidak mempunyai 'uzur…) ' (Qs. An Nisaa; 95). Sa'id tidak menyebutkan kata, 'membaca","grades":[{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3975-alalbani","name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3975-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid","name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3975-zubairalizai","name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}]},{"id":"69b6c59add1a4c9c86f09689","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320","bookIndex":32,"hadithIndex":3976,"bookHadithIndex":8,"text":"Telah menceritakan kepada kami [Utsman bin Abu Syaibah] dan [Muhammad bin Al 'Ala] mereka berkata; telah menceritakan kepada kami [Abdullah bin Al Mubarak] telah menceritakan kepada kami [Yunus bin Yazid] dari [Abu Ali bin Yazid] dari [Az Zuhri] dari [Anas bin Malik] ia berkata, \"Rasulullah shallallahu 'alaihi wasallam membaca ayat: '(... dan mata dengan mata) ' (Qs. Al Maidah:)","grades":[{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3976-alalbani","name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3976-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid","name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Daif"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3976-zubairalizai","name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}]},{"id":"69b6c59add1a4c9c86f0968a","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320","bookIndex":32,"hadithIndex":3977,"bookHadithIndex":9,"text":"","grades":[{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3977-alalbani","name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3977-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid","name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Daif"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3977-shuaibalarnaut","name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Daif"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3977-zubairalizai","name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}]},{"id":"69b6c59add1a4c9c86f0968b","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320","bookIndex":32,"hadithIndex":3978,"bookHadithIndex":10,"text":"Telah menceritakan kepada kami [An Nufaili] telah menceritakan kepada kami [Zuhair] telah menceritakan kepada kami [Fudlail bin Marzuq] dari ['Athiyyah bin Sa'dan Al 'Aufi] ia berkata, \"Aku pernah membacakan kepada [Abdullah bin Umar] ayat: 'ALLAHULLADZII KHALAQAKUM MIN DLA'FIN… (Allah, Dialah yang menciptakan kamu dari keadaan lemah...) (Qs. Ar Ruum: 54) ', kemudian ia berkata, 'MIN DLU'FIN…(dari kelemahan) -dengan dlammah-', aku pernah membacakan ayat tersebut kepada Rasulullah shallallahu 'alaihi wasallam sebagaimana engkau telah membacakannya kepadaku, kemudian beliau mengoreksiku sebagaimana aku telah mengoreksimu","grades":[{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3978-alalbani","name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3978-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid","name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Hasan"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3978-shuaibalarnaut","name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Daif"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3978-zubairalizai","name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}]},{"id":"69b6c59add1a4c9c86f0968c","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320","bookIndex":32,"hadithIndex":3979,"bookHadithIndex":11,"text":"Telah menceritakan kepada kami [Muhammad bin Yahya Al Qutha'i] telah menceritakan kepada kami ['Ubaid bin 'Aqil] dari [Harun] dari [Abdullah bin Jabir] dari ['Athiyyah] dari [Abu Sa'id] dari Nabi shallallahu 'alaihi wasallam, beliau membaca: 'MIN DLU'FIN (dari kelemahan) (Qs. Ar Ruum: 54). -dengan harakat dlammah","grades":[{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3979-alalbani","name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3979-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid","name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Hasan"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3979-shuaibalarnaut","name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Daif"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3979-zubairalizai","name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}]},{"id":"69b6c59add1a4c9c86f0968d","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320","bookIndex":32,"hadithIndex":3980,"bookHadithIndex":12,"text":"","grades":[{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3980-alalbani","name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3980-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid","name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3980-shuaibalarnaut","name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Hasan"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3980-zubairalizai","name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}]},{"id":"69b6c59add1a4c9c86f0968e","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320","bookIndex":32,"hadithIndex":3981,"bookHadithIndex":13,"text":"Telah menceritakan kepada kami [Muhammad bin Abdullah] telah menceritakan kepada kami [Al Mughirah bin Salamah] telah menceritakan kepada kami [Ibnu Al Mubarak] dari [Al Ajlah] telah menceritakan kepadaku [Abdullah bin Abdurrahman bin Abza] dari [ayahnya] dari [Ubai] bahwa Nabi shallallahu 'alaihi wasallam pernah membaca ayat: BIFADHLILLAAHI WA RAHMATIHI, FABIDZAALIKA FAL TAFRAHUU, HUWA KHAIRUN MIMMAA TAJMA'UUN (Katakanlah: \"Dengan karunia Allah dan rahmat-Nya, hendaklah dengan itu kalian bergembira. Karunia Allah dan rahmat-Nya itu adalah lebih baik dari apa yang kalian kumpulkan.\");","grades":[{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3981-alalbani","name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3981-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid","name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3981-zubairalizai","name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}]},{"id":"69b6c59add1a4c9c86f0968f","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320","bookIndex":32,"hadithIndex":3982,"bookHadithIndex":14,"text":"Telah menceritakan kepada kami [Musa bin Isma'il] telah menceritakan kepada kami [Hammad] telah mengabarkan kepada kami [Tsabit] dari [Syahr bin Hausyab] dari [Asma` binti Yazid], bahwa ia pernah mendengar Nabi shallallahu 'alaihi wasallam membaca: 'INNAHUU 'AMILA GHAIRA SHAALIH (Sesungguhnya ia telah melakukan perbuatan yang tidak baik) '. (Qs. Huud:)","grades":[{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3982-alalbani","name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"id":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-32-3982-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid","name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":